{"3669740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The You Quiz", "steam_appid": 3669740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4224450], "detailed_description": "<h1>Friend's Pass</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/9185cf9de37316bda776bd74243bef8d.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1024 height=151 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/5cb6ba0407354dc438b0e069ef908eb1.poster.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/5cb6ba0407354dc438b0e069ef908eb1.webm?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO KNOWS YOU BEST?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The You Quiz </strong>is a <strong>multiplayer party game</strong> designed for <strong>3 to 8 players</strong>. <br>Perfect for game nights with friends or family, it also works great as an icebreaker at social gatherings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASYMMETRICAL PARTY GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player gets to be the King. Everyone else? Courtiers desperate for approval.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE COURTIER'S TASK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/25cae1b5fe4fbab7a3c8e266fe72ea86.poster.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/25cae1b5fe4fbab7a3c8e266fe72ea86.webm?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/25cae1b5fe4fbab7a3c8e266fe72ea86.mp4?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess the King’s opinion on personal, weird, or hilarious prompts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“What's King's unpopular opinion?”<br>“It's the end of the world. What is King's first reaction?”<br>“Name three things King hates:”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e97ea1beed293f0369989efa63de4f41.poster.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e97ea1beed293f0369989efa63de4f41.webm?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e97ea1beed293f0369989efa63de4f41.mp4?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better know your friend! Answer with insight, flattery, or playful nonsense. Whatever makes them feel seen, smile, laugh, or glow with pride.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE KING DECIDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e1a4f8661d38f133aa6ac1f3926c1816.poster.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e1a4f8661d38f133aa6ac1f3926c1816.webm?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e1a4f8661d38f133aa6ac1f3926c1816.mp4?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the King, you judge every answer:<br>👎 Meh? Reject it.<br>👍 Pretty good? One step forward.<br>❤️ Nailed it? Two steps up the stairs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e573bed14027849fd12c6cfbe7d6332c.poster.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e573bed14027849fd12c6cfbe7d6332c.webm?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e573bed14027849fd12c6cfbe7d6332c.mp4?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your court, your rules. Reward brilliance. Punish mediocrity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DETHRONE THE KING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/fa1be2b8568b33cc2477e0b7663e3381.poster.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/fa1be2b8568b33cc2477e0b7663e3381.webm?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/fa1be2b8568b33cc2477e0b7663e3381.mp4?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First to reach the top of the stairs steals the crown. Then they become the new King!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND YOUR TITLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each game, players earn titles that match their vibe.<br>Were you the <strong><i>Don Juan</i></strong>? The <strong><i>Emperor</i></strong>? The <strong><i>Jealous</i></strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 30+ titles! Bragging rights included.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY IT ONLINE OR ON THE COUCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/0b5d97a9c6739de6925bc47cc5530188.poster.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/0b5d97a9c6739de6925bc47cc5530188.webm?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/0b5d97a9c6739de6925bc47cc5530188.mp4?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick and easy to set up, <strong>The You Quiz </strong>is perfect for livening up any game night with friends or family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it locally on the couch, using your phone or tablet as a controller. Or play it online with <strong>only one copy required</strong> (your friends can use the <strong><u>free</u></strong> friend pass).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH YOUR FAMILY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the <strong>child-friendly mode</strong>, playing with kids becomes effortless. You can also disable any themes you find inappropriate with just a toggle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS FUN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 1,000 personal questions, no two games ever feel the same. You can write your own questions and add them directly to the game, or browse the Workshop and add question packs from the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e530ece79a9d9869038888b973273ac5.avif?t=1773918530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras_big/e530ece79a9d9869038888b973273ac5.webp?t=1773918530 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the court yours. Enable the new Hate Button for bold vetoes, tweak the size of the Stairs, adjust timers, and fine-tune a wide range of settings. Pick the themes you want to play with. Think you know your friends? Prove it in The You Quiz.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/5cb6ba0407354dc438b0e069ef908eb1.poster.avif?t=1773918530\" width=1600 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/5cb6ba0407354dc438b0e069ef908eb1.webm?t=1773918530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO KNOWS YOU BEST?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The You Quiz </strong>is a <strong>multiplayer party game</strong> designed for <strong>3 to 8 players</strong>. <br>Perfect for game nights with friends or family, it also works great as an icebreaker at social gatherings!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASYMMETRICAL PARTY GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player gets to be the King. Everyone else? Courtiers desperate for approval.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE COURTIER'S TASK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/25cae1b5fe4fbab7a3c8e266fe72ea86.