lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras/e530ece79a9d9869038888b973273ac5.avif?t=1773918530\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/extras_big/e530ece79a9d9869038888b973273ac5.webp?t=1773918530 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the court yours. Enable the new Hate Button for bold vetoes, tweak the size of the Stairs, adjust timers, and fine-tune a wide range of settings. Pick the themes you want to play with. Think you know your friends? Prove it in The You Quiz.</p>", "short_description": "The You Quiz is a multiplayer game where the questions are about you! Be the King and judge your friends' answers about yourself. Or be a Courtier, guess their quirks, tastes, and dreams. Invite up to 7 friends for free using the Friend's Pass!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Spanish - Spain, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Italian, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/bd812c1522d0c3e5dbbec5de41f6398ae1ea2c50/header.jpg?t=1773918530", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/73194d6969db6a699f4043f721e95e2696325399/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773918530", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669740/73194d6969db6a699f4043f721e95e2696325399/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773918530", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  2.66 Ghz Core 2 Duo or Greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br><